<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 3.196 points off FTSE 100.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 3.196 points off FTSE 100.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will trade ex-dividend on December 2. Analysts estimate this will take 3.196 points off the FTSE 100.</p>
<p>					    DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>					    (PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>	COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>    * Allied Domecq		 14.15 17.69    1.073</p>
<p>    * Cable &amp; Wireless		3.4   4.25     0.556</p>
<p>    * Courtaulds Plc		4.45  5.56     0.132</p>
<p>    * National Grid		  4.45  5.56     0.555</p>
<p>    * National Power		 6.0   7.5	0.531</p>
<p>    * Safeway Plc		    4.4   5.5	0.349</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
